# MDX lesson content is NOT formatted by Prettier.
# Prettier's markdown/MDX parser mangles code samples embedded in JSX
# template-literal props (e.g. <SandboxExercise initialCode={`...`} />),
# corrupting `_` and `*` in C/other code and producing non-idempotent
# output that fails `prettier --check`. Lessons are authored hand-formatted.
**/*.mdx
